      "content": "okay that makes sense so far. but looking at my actual numbers, the interest amount is so high that it's eating up almost 80% of my payment. it feels like there's something extra being added on that isn't just the interest rate. like something is working behind the scenes to keep the balance high. can you explain why the decay of the principal is so slow at the start?",
